      "id": "claim_e892475d63cc4777853b26d3a386ac7f",
      "statement": "The gatekeeper contract is three-tier: GatekeeperVendor (WorkerEntrypoint: describe, connectAccount OAuth flow, getSupportedResources, getTypeScriptTypes, optional createAccount for auto-provisioning), GatekeeperUser (per connected account: getGatekeeperClassFor, startResourceConfigurator, reconnect/revoke, getVerifier, optional singleton + management UI), and Gatekeeper<Session> (per-binding DO facet: describe, getTypeScriptTypes, startSession guarded by ApprovalQueue, addObserver/removeObserver, applyAction/rejectAction/revertAction).",
