      "id": "claim_ebfe698a37d446f0aa02a93ef9ed0463",
      "statement": "Gatekeeper discovery is purely by binding name: the backend builds its vendor map from env keys prefixed GATEKEEPER_ (vendor id = lowercased suffix) and the router routes /gatekeeper/<suffix>/* from the same keys, so installing a gatekeeper is a binding change with no code edits.",
