      "id": "claim_1c32a477339145f1a86aceb741f8ea29",
      "statement": "OverseerClientInterface.newGatekeeper resolves the resource through the opening client user's own account (getGatekeeperClassFor), not the owner's, so collaborators never gain access to each other's connected services; inside the User DO that method is the single chokepoint that throws when the admin config disables the vendor or the specific resource URL pattern before a capability is minted.",
