      "id": "claim_3d698915fb644bfca81270ee9014968c",
      "statement": "GatekeeperUser.getGatekeeperClassFor returns a DurableObjectClass imbued via ctx.props with the user's credentials and the matched resource — only the class reference crosses to the overseer, keeping the account capability encapsulated; OverseerImpl.addGatekeeper then allocates a workpiece id, stores the GatekeeperRecord (class, creation spec, denormalized title/url/slash flag), installs the gatekeeper${id} facet, backfills denormalized fields from describe(), and rolls the record back if describe throws.",
