    {
      "id": "claim_54e4061f4a394cb492c112e600b527d2",
      "statement": "Removing a gatekeeper connection destroys its facet and record and severs every gadget binding edge pointing at it so no gadget env retains a dangling entry, while GadgetClient.unbind merely deletes one edge and leaves the record alive (possibly orphaned); sessions are opened through GatekeeperClientImpl.openSession, which resolves the facet and calls startSession(approvalQueue).",
