      "id": "claim_27f32d389b8e45888afeeaaf8d949336",
      "statement": "Two gatekeeper types are core-implemented rather than external workers: LanguageModelGatekeeper (describes as models.local/<provider>/<model>, session exposes LanguageModelBinding.run, no auto-approvable actions, observer no-op) and AgentSpawnerGatekeeper (session offers spawn/spawnCallable; its env config is validated at creation for valid binding names and existing, non-pending targets; creatorUserId rides the props so trigger-time model resolution bills the creating user).",
