      "id": "claim_88eb48ce944c4bdcb52f0ce800a500c5",
      "statement": "Both gatekeeper UI shapes are GatekeeperUiFrames hosted in sandboxed iframes: resource configurators come from UserDurableObject.startResourceConfigurator(accountId, resourceUrlPattern) inside the connect modal, while management apps are listed by AuthenticatedApi.listGatekeeperApps (which auto-provisions singleton accounts idempotently first) and fetched via startAccountAppUi(accountId, {isAdmin}) with isAdmin supplied fresh per open; apps are addressed by vendor id at /gatekeepers/$appId.",
