      "id": "claim_e33ee15906bf4edf959ee6a3aecfedcb",
      "statement": "Auto-provisioning gatekeepers have a per-vendor admin mode (disabled/optional/enabled, defaulting to optional) resolved only in provisioning-policy.ts; enabled forces one account per user hidden from the Connectors list. A singleton account is installed into the owner's workspaces as an ambient gatekeeper record by ensureAmbientCapsules on every open(), reconciling stale account ids and provisioning missing singletons concurrently through getSingletonGatekeeperClass so sessions run gadget-side in the gatekeeper's own worker.",
