      "id": "claim_c67f054a1a7544d9941b437b346de173",
      "statement": "Hooks deliver push events through persistent stubs: the gadget creates the callback with ctx.restore, the gatekeeper must never store it (it is session-bound) and instead calls approvalQueue.bindHook(controller, callback, description) with a HookController whose props carry all needed state; on user approval the overseer calls controller.enable(initiator, target), and each event delivery calls initiator.startHook() to obtain a fresh callback + ApprovalQueue bound to a new session before authorizing the observation.",
